# What the node does not need. ChefSpec re-uploads the cookbook for every
# example and Test Kitchen copies it into the sandbox, so generated material
# stays out: the apt archive cache alone is ~945 MB, and without this list every
# ChefSpec example spends seconds checksumming it. Patterns need the trailing
# `**`; a bare `dir/` matches nothing under Chef's `File.fnmatch?`.
.kitchen/**
.kitchen.yml
.kitchen.local.yml
.git/**
.gitignore
.rspec
Gemfile
Gemfile.lock
Rakefile
README.md
coverage/**
spec/**
test/fixtures/cache/**
test/fixtures/logs/**
test/fixtures/shared/**
